# GitBook Documentation Rules

This repo is a GitBook space synced with GitHub. Read `skill.md` in the repo root for full syntax.

## Before structural changes

1. Read `SUMMARY.md` first
2. Check `.gitbook.yaml` for root path and redirects
3. Check `.gitbook/vars.yaml` if using space variables

## When editing

- Keep `SUMMARY.md` synchronized with new, moved, or renamed pages
- Use relative paths for internal links (e.g. `[text](core-functionality/audio.md)`)
- Close all `{% %}` custom blocks (`{% endtab %}`, `{% endhint %}`, etc.)
- Put space variables in `.gitbook/vars.yaml`; page variables in frontmatter `vars:`
- Never embed OpenAPI specs in markdown — upload via GitBook API/CLI/UI
- Manage `README.md` only in this repository, not via GitBook UI

## Pre-commit checks

- No duplicate page entries in `SUMMARY.md`
- Valid YAML frontmatter on pages that use it
- Images reference `.gitbook/assets/` or valid external URLs
- Run `scripts/validate-gitbook.ps1` before committing
